<section class="positioning" aria-label="What I do">
  <div class="container pos-grid">
    <div class="pos-left">
      <span class="eyebrow">— What I do</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Any type of data question, from a messy export to a live dashboard.</h2>
      <p class="pos-body">Send me the spreadsheet everyone&apos;s afraid of. I&apos;ll tell you what&apos;s in it, what&apos;s wrong with it, and what it&apos;s worth knowing.</p>
      <a href="mailto:anjumsadat09082@gmail.com?subject=Project%20inquiry" class="text-link">anjumsadat09082@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="pos-right">
      <p class="pos-body">Most reporting problems aren&apos;t analysis problems. They&apos;re plumbing problems — the same numbers pulled by hand, reconciled by hand, and pasted into a deck by hand every morning. I fix the plumbing first, then the analysis gets interesting.</p>
      <div class="stat-row" role="list" aria-label="Key statistics">
        <div class="stat-item" role="listitem" aria-label="20 plus distribution hubs monitored daily">
          <span class="stat-number">20+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Distribution hubs monitored daily</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item" role="listitem" aria-label="Four analytics projects shipped">
          <span class="stat-number">4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Analytics projects shipped</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item" role="listitem" aria-label="Three years teaching and presenting">
          <span class="stat-number">3</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Years teaching &amp; presenting</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.positioning { background-color: var(--surface-deep); padding: var(--space-9) 0; }
.pos-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: start; }
.pos-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }
.pos-body { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--step-p); color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; }
.stat-row { display: flex; gap: var(--space-6); margin-top: var(--space-4); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.stat-item { flex: 1; }
.stat-number { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-stat); font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
.stat-label { display: block; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--step-small); color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-1); line-height: 1.4; }

@media (max-width: 1023px) {
  .pos-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-6); }
  .stat-row { gap: var(--space-4); }
}
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .stat-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stat-item { min-width: 140px; flex: 1 1 calc(50% - var(--space-3)); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .positioning { animation: none !important; } }
</style>
